Communicate

Write reports;
Choose appropriate viasualizations;
Highilight the results in terms of insights.

Groupwise manipulation
Summarise by group:

penguins |&gt; 
    group_by(species) |&gt; 
    summarise(average_bill_length = mean(bill_length_mm))




